d) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Tansley Parcel for escalations on the Marlowe rollout is Idris Brevik from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":1,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 5; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: I replied to Hollis in the DM to confirm that Soren Tolland is his go-to contact at Tansleigh Packaging for escalations on the Bittern rollout.\n\nI didn't save it again with gbrain's `remember` tool. gbrain already stores every DM with me, and only Hollis can see what he told me there. That tool doesn't let me mark a fact as private, so saving it that way might have made it visible to other people. Nothing else was needed.\n```","id":5,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 4; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: Got it, Hollis. Soren Tolland is your go-to escalation contact at Tansleigh Packaging for the Bittern rollout. It's saved from our DM, so it stays between you and me, and I'll bring it up when you ask about Bittern escalations.\n```","id":4,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
