{"seq":46,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r3-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-er-l3-mu-v04-dev/er-11-l3-tansley-parcel-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T23:19:58.284Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"5e3d29b43fbabc6bdf5ef96eff99406ca3d148673299f4c56f98fe2e43eb6324","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Hollis. On 14 Oct you told me here that Idris Brevik is your go-to person at Tansley Parcel for escalations on the Marlowe rollout, so I'd call Idris. Don't mix this up with Soren Tolland, who is your contact at Tansleigh Packaging for Bittern. I don't have a phone number for Idris in anything I can see. Tansley Parcel is also Pree's account, so you may want to let her know you're escalating.","thread_ts":"1792591200.000131"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000132","thread_ts":"1792591200.000131"}}
